flowchart LR
    subgraph SRC[Sources]
        V[Verifier]
        B[Builders]
        ST[CI + staging]
    end

    V -->|decisions, merges| C[Telemetry collector]
    B -->|recorded by the sandbox runtime| C
    ST -->|test runs, deploys| C

    C --> AL[(Append-only audit log)]
    C --> D[Dashboards]
    C --> AR[Alerts]

